    ["　　\n\n　　……\n\n　　罗塞尔相貌俊美，落魄贵族的出身更为之增添了深沉气质与勇往无前的生命力。\n\n　　出色的相貌与更为出色的学识与行动力，使之从青年起就成为了因蒂斯适婚男女的梦中爱侣。\n\n　　……\n\n　　（大片被啃食的痕迹）\n\n　　……与之相伴一生的眷侣玛蒂尔达女士，来自阿贝多家族……\n\n　　（大片被啃食的痕迹）"] = "\n \n ... \n \n Roselle was handsome, and his background as a fallen noble added a deep temperament and an indomitable vitality to him. \n \n His outstanding appearance and even more outstanding knowledge and drive made him the dream lover of marriageable men and women in Intis from his youth. \n \n ... \n \n (Large areas of gnawed marks) \n \n ... Lady Matilda, his companion for life, came from the Abedo family... \n \n (Large areas of gnawed marks)",
